    "text": "<p>Match List <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> with List <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math>.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>List <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> With Ore</td>\t\t\t<td>List <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math> Composition</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A.Siderite</td>\t\t\t<td>I.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B.Malachite</td>\t\t\t<td>II.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>Cu</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C.Sphalerite</td>\t\t\t<td>III.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ZnS</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D.Calamine</td>\t\t\t<td>IV.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ZnCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
